data: {"id": "65dc5e39ab844df0-thinking-parallel_evidence-772", "run_id": "65dc5e39ab844df0", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 2. 采集结论与证据评估\n\n### 实体身份与生命周期确认\n- **Pod**: `workload`，namespace: `aiops-case-v11`，UID: `f99c513d-bc63-43ba-bc90-111cd5958ce7`\n- **状态**: Pending，`CreateContainerConfigError` 持续约 60 分钟（58m x12 over 60m），未恢复\n- **节点**: `node2`，Pod IP: `172.16.104.26`\n- **容器**: `app`，镜像 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`，无重启\n\n### 证据汇总\n\n| 维度 | 事实 | 与候选原因的关系 |\n|------|------|------------------|\n| **kubectl_events** | `Warning Failed: Error: couldn't find key unavailable-key in ConfigMap aiops-case-v", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789148876348, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

